#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:278
msgid ""
"The shipment is registered once, the first time an order reaches this "
"status. Leave unset to send nothing automatically."
msgstr ""
"Saadetis registreeritakse üks kord, kui tellimus esimest korda selle oleku "
"saab. Jäta valimata, kui midagi ei tohi automaatselt saata."

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:281
