msgid "Tracking text"
msgstr "Jälgimise tekst"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:289
msgid "Your parcel is on its way. Track it here: {tracking_link}"
msgstr "Sinu pakk on teel. Jälgi seda siin: {tracking_link}"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:290
msgid ""
"Shown in order e-mails and under My account, once the parcel has a barcode. "
"Placeholders: {tracking_code}, {tracking_url}, {tracking_link}, {carrier}."
msgstr ""
"Kuvatakse tellimuse e-kirjades ja Minu konto all, kui pakil on pakikood. "
"Kohatäited: {tracking_code}, {tracking_url}, {tracking_link}, {carrier}."

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:293
msgid "Show the tracking text in"
msgstr "Näita jälgimise teksti"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shipment-settings.php:299
msgid ""
"Which customer e-mails carry it. An e-mail sent before the parcel has a "
"barcode carries nothing."
msgstr ""
"Millistes kliendi e-kirjades see on. Enne pakikoodi tekkimist saadetud e-"
"kirjas seda ei ole."

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:112
msgid "Sender name"
msgstr "Saatja nimi"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:113
msgid ""
"Filled in from the shop address under WooCommerce -> Settings -> General. "
"Correct anything the carrier should see differently."
msgstr ""
"Täidetud poe aadressist (WooCommerce -> Seaded -> Üldine). Paranda, kui "
"vedaja peab nägema midagi muud."

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:116
msgid "Sender phone"
msgstr "Saatja telefon"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:117
msgid ""
"WooCommerce keeps no telephone number for the shop, so this one is yours to "
"fill in. The carrier calls it when something goes wrong with a parcel."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce poe telefoninumbrit ei hoia, seega täida see ise. Vedaja "
"helistab sellele, kui pakiga on probleem."

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:120
msgid "Sender e-mail"
msgstr "Saatja e-post"

#: includes/shipments/class-wc-esm-shop-address.php:121
