msgid "Password"
msgstr "Parool"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:216
msgid "Payer code"
msgstr "Maksja kood"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:219
msgid "The contract DPD bills. Your account manager has it."
msgstr ""
"Leping, mille alusel DPD arveid esitab. Selle saad oma kliendihaldurilt."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:224
msgid "Service alias"
msgstr "Teenuse lühinimi"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:227
msgid ""
"The short alias DPD lists against the service on your contract - PS for a "
"parcel shop, CLASSIC for a business delivery. Not the name it shows beside "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Lühinimi, mis on sinu DPD lepingus teenuse juures - PS pakipoe jaoks, "
"CLASSIC ärikliendile tarneks. Mitte nimi, mida selle kõrval näidatakse."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:232
msgid "Cash on delivery service alias"
msgstr "Lunarahateenuse lühinimi"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:235
msgid ""
"Leave empty unless your contract carries one. A name DPD does not recognise "
"has it refuse the whole shipment, not just the service."
msgstr ""
"Jäta tühjaks, kui sinu lepingus seda pole. Kui DPD nime ei tunne, lükkab ta "
"tagasi kogu saadetise, mitte ainult teenuse."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-dpd.php:240
