msgstr "Omniva"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:143
msgid "API host"
msgstr "API server"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:146
msgid ""
"Omniva issues this per customer. Leave the default unless they gave you "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Omniva väljastab selle igale kliendile eraldi. Jäta vaikeväärtus, kui sulle "
"pole teist antud."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:160
msgid "Integration agent id"
msgstr "Integratsiooniagendi ID"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:163
msgid ""
"The Developer_XXXXXX_YYYYYY value Omniva issued. Every request carries it."
msgstr ""
"Omniva väljastatud väärtus kujul Developer_XXXXXX_YYYYYY. See on igas "
"päringus kaasas."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:167
msgid "Customer code"
msgstr "Kliendikood"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:170
msgid "The AXA partner code from your Omniva contract."
msgstr "AXA partneri kood sinu Omniva lepingust."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:178
msgid "Cash on delivery service code"
msgstr "Lunarahateenuse kood"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:181
msgid ""
"Omniva issues the additional service list per customer. Confirm this code "
"with them before charging cash on delivery."
msgstr ""
"Omniva annab lisateenuste nimekirja igale kliendile eraldi. Enne lunaraha "
"kasutamist kinnita see kood Omnivaga."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:186
msgid "Cash on delivery bank account"
msgstr "Lunaraha pangakonto"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:189
msgid ""
"The IBAN Omniva pays the collected money into. Cash on delivery does not "
"work without it."
msgstr "IBAN, kuhu Omniva kogutud raha kannab. Ilma selleta lunaraha ei tööta."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:217
msgid "Omniva accepted the parcel but returned no barcode for it."
msgstr "Omniva võttis paki vastu, kuid ei tagastanud pakikoodi."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-omniva.php:259
msgid "Omniva returned no labels."
msgstr "Omniva ei tagastanud silte."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:73
