msgstr "Smartposti"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:108
msgid "The business client key Smartposti issued. Every request carries it."
msgstr "Smartposti väljastatud ärikliendi võti. See on igas päringus kaasas."

