#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:135
msgid ""
"Sent with the sender address, which Smartposti wants together with a size or "
"not at all. Leave unset to send neither."
msgstr ""
"Saadetakse koos saatja aadressiga, mida Smartposti tahab koos suurusega või "
"üldse mitte. Jäta valimata, kui kumbagi ei saadeta."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:138
msgid "Do not send one"
msgstr "Ära saada"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:148
msgid "Days a customer has to return a parcel"
msgstr "Päevi paki tagastamiseks"

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:151
msgid "Leave empty for the carrier default."
msgstr "Jäta tühjaks, et kasutada vedaja vaikeväärtust."

#: includes/shipments/providers/class-wc-esm-provider-smartpost.php:178
msgid "Smartposti accepted the parcel but returned no barcode for it."
msgstr "Smartposti võttis paki vastu, kuid ei tagastanud pakikoodi."

